    <cmns-av:explanatoryNote>Deprecated usage: "NOK-NIBOR-NIBR" code has been deprecated in supplement 49 to the 2006 ISDA definitions. The code is kept in FpML for backward compatibility purposes.</cmns-av:explanatoryNote>
    <cmns-av:explanatoryNote>Per 2006 ISDA Definitions or Annex to the 2000 ISDA Definitions, Section 7.1 Rate Options, as amended and supplemented through the date on which parties enter into the relevant transaction.</cmns-av:explanatoryNote>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/MarketsIndividuals/MIC-XBES">
