  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/Partnerships/Partnerships/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>Partnerships Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology defines partnerships and related concepts. The concepts distinguish general from limited partners, as well as the types of equity that they hold. Included are abstract definitions of partnership types based on whether they have general, limited or both kinds of partners. Both legally incorporated and non incorporated forms of partnerships are covered.</dcterms:abstract>
    <dcterms:license>Copyright (c) 2013-2025 EDM Council, Inc.
