    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>U.S. Postal Service Addresses Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology augments the Addresses ontology in FND with concepts that conform to the USPS Pub 28. The USPS provides automated address verification services that use the concepts defined herein for that purpose, and which many financial services entities use for data quality purposes.</dcterms:abstract>
