    <cmns-av:explanatoryNote>The 'all' ontology for SEC example individuals is provided for convenience for FIBO users. This ontology does not add new assertions, but imports all of the Production (Released) ontologies that comprise the FIBO Foundations (FND), Business Entities (BE), Financial Business and Commerce (FBC), Indices and Indicators (IND), and Securities (SEC) domains, including all individuals, with examples of how to encode information for a specific exchange-traded security.</cmns-av:explanatoryNote>
  </rdf:Description>
