  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/FinancialServicesEntities/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>Financial Services Entities Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology defines basic financial service providers, such as holding companies, financial institutions (both depository and non-depository institutions), and clearing houses at a relatively general level. Nuances specific to the institutions located in a specific country are defined in jurisdiction specific dependent ontologies.</dcterms:abstract>
