  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/DER/DerivativesContracts/Swaps/RealizedVariableLeg">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/DER/DerivativesContracts/Swaps/PerformanceBasedVariableLeg"/>
    <rdfs:label>realized variable leg</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>performance-based leg wherein the payment is netted at maturity rather than periodically</skos:definition>
    <cmns-av:explanatoryNote>In this case there is a single payment at maturity/settlement and so there is no stream of cashflows either way. The other leg of these swaps is implied, and is simply the strike price.</cmns-av:explanatoryNote>
  </rdf:Description>
