    <rdfs:label>ACTUS contract type - undefined maturity profile</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:source>https://www.actusfrf.org/taxonomy</dcterms:source>
    <skos:definition>cashflow classifier that applies to contracts whose principal may be paid in and out at any point in time without prefixed schedule</skos:definition>
    <skos:note>Interest calculated on outstanding and capitalized periodically. Needs link to a behavioral function describing expected flows.</skos:note>
    <fibo-actus-acv:hasCoverageDescription>Saving products of all kind, current accounts. In some countries even variable rate mortgages can be represented with this contract type.</fibo-actus-acv:hasCoverageDescription>
    <cmns-cls:isClassifiedBy rdf:resource="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/ACTUS/ACTUSControlledVocabulary/ACTUSCashFlowFamily-Basic"/>
