  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/DER/DerivativesContracts/Options/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Options Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>Concepts common to all option contracts. An option gives one party (the holder) the right to purchase or sell the underlying instrument at a given time or times in the future (as determined by the exercise convention), if they choose to do so.</dcterms:abstract>
