  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/Corporations/Corporations/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>Corporations Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology defines the fundamental concepts for companies incorporated by the issuance of shares. Terms defined in this ontology are those which are applicable to all such entities. Many of these concepts form the basis of the relationships of ownership and control which obtain between entities of this type.</dcterms:abstract>
