  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FinancialInstruments/FinancialInstruments/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>Financial Instruments Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology defines the fundamental concepts for financial instruments in general, providing the high-level hooks for build-out in more detail in the relevant domain areas. These include, but are not limited to, equities, options, debt instruments, and so forth, some of which may be negotiable.</dcterms:abstract>
