    <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/20230101/AllBE-ReferenceIndividuals/"/>
    <cmns-av:explanatoryNote>The 'all' ontology for BE (Reference Individuals) is provided for convenience for FIBO users. This ontology does not add new assertions, but imports all of the Production (Released) ontologies that comprise the FIBO Business Entities (BE) domain, including all of FND, and all of the individual entities and jurisdictions in FIBO production.</cmns-av:explanatoryNote>
