  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/BusinessRegistries/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>Business Registries Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology extends the Registration Authorities ontology to define specific kinds of registries, such as business entity registries, registries for identifiers and codes of various sorts, and registries for financial institutions and intermediaries based on jurisdiction, who regulates them, and the services they provide.</dcterms:abstract>
    <dcterms:license>Copyright (c) 2015-2025 EDM Council, Inc.
