    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The condition that some default or potential default is ongoing in respect to the other party. Further notes: Conditions precedent typically include that no default is ongoing, so this is typically or always "no". Sample text (of which this term is a part): " the condition precedent that no Event of Default or Potential Event of Default with respect to the other party has occurred and is continuing, "</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
