  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/AsianJurisdiction/CentralAsiaGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>Central Asia Government Entities and Jurisdictions Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology provides government entities and jurisdictions for countries that are defined as being part of Central Asia in the U.N. M49 codes, primarily those that are considered independent countries in ISO 3166, or are important from a banking perspective.</dcterms:abstract>
