  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/Organizations/Organizations/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>Organizations Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology defines high-level concepts for organizations and related terms, which is purposefully underspecified to facilitate mapping to specific organization ontologies, such as the W3C organization ontology, organization from a BMM or BPMN perspective, organization from a records management (RMS) perspective, and so forth.</dcterms:abstract>
    <dcterms:license>Copyright (c) 2013-2025 EDM Council, Inc.
