  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/GovernmentEntities/EuropeanJurisdiction/NorthernEuropeGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>Northern Europe Government Entities and Jurisdictions Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology provides government entities and jurisdictions for countries that are defined as being part of Northern Europe in the U.N. M49 codes, primarily those that are considered independent countries in ISO 3166, or are important from a banking perspective.</dcterms:abstract>
