  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/NorthAmericanEntities/USRegulatoryAgencies/UniformBankPerformanceReportRepository">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://www.omg.org/spec/Commons/RegistrationAuthorities/Registry"/>
    <rdfs:label>Uniform Bank Performance Report (UBPR) Repository</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/NorthAmericanEntities/USRegulatoryAgencies/"/>
    <skos:definition>Federal Financial Institutions Examination Council (FFIEC)'s Uniform Bank Performance Report (UBPR) Repository, a repository of institution characteristics and analytical tool created for bank supervisory, examination, and management purposes</skos:definition>
    <cmns-av:explanatoryNote>In a concise format, it shows the impact of management decisions and economic conditions on a bank's performance and balance-sheet composition. The performance and composition data contained in the report can be used as an aid in evaluating the adequacy of earnings, liquidity, capital, asset and liability management, and growth management. Bankers and examiners alike can use this report to further their understanding of a bank's financial condition, and through such understanding, perform their duties more effectively.</cmns-av:explanatoryNote>
    <cmns-org:isManagedBy rdf:resource="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/NorthAmericanEntities/USRegulatoryAgencies/FederalFinancialInstitutionsExaminationRegulator"/>
  </rdf:Description>
