  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/OwnershipAndControl/CorporateControl/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>Corporate Control Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology defines concepts relating to corporation-specific control. These concepts are based on the general types of control (both de facto control and controlling interests), as defined in the ControlParties ontology, and are the specific examples of these concepts as they apply to companies incorporated by the issuance of shares.</dcterms:abstract>
