    <rdfs:label>ACTUS contract type - future</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>cashflow classifier that applies to futures</skos:definition>
    <skos:note>Keeps track of value changes for any basic contract as underlying (PAM, ANN etc. but also FXOUT, STK, COM). Handles margining calls.</skos:note>
