  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/DER/SecurityBasedDerivatives/EquitySwaps/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Equity Swaps Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology defines concepts specific to swap contracts in which one leg gives some form of return on an equity asset, including dividend returns, total asset returns equity dispersion and correlation measurement terms. Many of these return calculations are based on a variety of calculation methods and may vary widely.</dcterms:abstract>
