    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">SyntheticCDOs</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>Synthetic collateralized debt obligations are instruments designed to provide the same kind of structure and returns as a CDO, but these are not backed by an actual pool of debt assets.</dcterms:abstract>
