    <rdfs:label>American statistics publisher</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>statistical information publisher comprised of the government agencies and departments that publish statistical information on behalf of the U.S. Federal Government</skos:definition>
    <skos:example>Examples of American statistical information publishers include the Department of Commerce, Bureau of Economic Analysis (Commerce), Census Bureau (Commerce), Bureau of Labor Statistics (Labor), Department of the Treasury, and the Federal Reserve Board, among others.</skos:example>
  </rdf:Description>
