  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/TransactionsExt/SecuritiesTransactions/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Securities Transactions Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>Describes the basic concepts for securities transactions, as an extension of market transactions more generally. Incudes types of securities transactions, parties to the transaction, settlement and the covering contract for the transaction. This ontology would form the basis for more detailed securities transaction concepts that would ideally be derived from the FIX standard.</dcterms:abstract>
