  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/FunctionalEntities/InternationalRegistriesAndAuthorities/">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology"/>
    <rdfs:label>International Registries and Authorities Ontology</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>This ontology extends the Business Registries ontology to define commonly referenced international registration authorities and related registry details, where the multi-national responsibilities for registering and/or managing various identifiers needed in banking applications occur, such as SWIFT. These individuals and in some cases, such as registry entries, are managed independently to reduce the import footprint for applications that do not require them, in other words, to support modularity needs of FIBO users.</dcterms:abstract>
