    <rdfs:label>futures commission merchant</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>party that does both of the following: (1) solicits or accepts orders to buy or sell futures contracts, options on futures, retail off-exchange forex contracts, or swaps and (2) accepts money or other assets from customers to support such orders</skos:definition>
