    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Restriction requiring an investor to refer to the fund order desk prior to redeeming a fund.</skos:definition>
    <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">While it's unclear from original data models, it's likely that this restriction is actually to learn from the fund order desk of any other individual kinds of restriction that will apply. This is itself treated as a kind of restriction here.</skos:editorialNote>
