    <rdfs:label>sole proprietorships module</rdfs:label>
    <dcterms:abstract>The sole proprietorships module includes ontologies describing business entities or financial ventures that are carried out by a single person who is directly responsible for all liabilities of that venture.</dcterms:abstract>
