  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BP/SecuritiesIssuance/PrivateLabelMBSIssuance/TrancheStructureAndTermsheet">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BP/SecuritiesIssuance/PrivateLabelMBSIssuance/TranchedMBSIssueProspectusPart"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">tranche structure and termsheet</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">One sheet defining the MBS structure.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The termsheet with the terms for individual tranches is a separate component, known as the Tranche Termsheet or Individual Tranche Definitions. These may in practice be in one sheet or document deliverable but is a set of termsheets defining the terms for the set of tranches. Term origin:MBS PoC Reviews</skos:definition>
  </rdf:Description>
