  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/IND/MarketIndices/EquityIndexExampleIndividuals/StandardAndPoors500CompositeIndexBasket">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/IND/MarketIndices/BasketIndices/BasketOfEquities"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:nodeID="N52bb8a5816f64788be95e05e9af94ff4"/>
    <rdfs:label>Standard &amp; Poor's Composite Index basket</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>basket of common shares issued by approximately 500 large-cap companies that are traded on American stock exchanges</skos:definition>
    <fibo-fbc-pas-fpas:hasSelectingParty rdf:resource="https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/IND/MarketIndices/EquityIndexExampleIndividuals/SPDowJonesIndicesLLC-US-DE"/>
    <fibo-fbc-pas-fpas:hasSelectionCriteria>To qualify for the S&amp;P 500, a company must meet certain committee-established criteria, which include (1) a market cap of at least $13.1 billion, (2) trading the value of its market capitalization annually, (3) at least a quarter-million of its shares have been traded in each of the previous six months (4) the majority of shares are in the public's hands, (5) being publicly traded for at least a year, and (6) earnings over the most recent four quarters and in the most recent quarter must be positive.</fibo-fbc-pas-fpas:hasSelectionCriteria>
  </rdf:Description>
