    <skos:definition>cashflow classifier that applies to margin contracts that traces the value changes and the different margin categories like inital and variation margin</skos:definition>
    <fibo-actus-acv:hasCoverageDescription>Margin contracts as applied in central depositories for any underlying or portfolio of underlying instruments.</fibo-actus-acv:hasCoverageDescription>
