    <rdfs:label>articles of incorporation</rdfs:label>
    <skos:definition>contract that establishes a new corporation or, when amended, adjusts the legal basis for the corporation, and outlines basic information about the corporation, including the type of business, and a description of the business' operational characteristics</skos:definition>
    <cmns-av:synonym>articles of association</cmns-av:synonym>
  </rdf:Description>
